  "description": "Cross-platform, COM-free .NET 8+ replacement for Altova.AltovaXML.dll (32-bit COM component).\nProvides XSLT 1.0 (BCL) plus XSLT 2.0/3.0 and XPath 2.0/3.1 through the bundled SaxonCS-HE engine,\nincluding managed emulation of the Altova extension namespace (xmlns:altova=\"http://www.altova.com/xslt-extensions\"),\nplus XML Schema 1.0 / DTD / well-formedness validation. Zero COM, AnyCPU only.\nReplicates the Altova.AltovaXML API surface (IApplication, IXSLT1/IXSLT2, IXQuery, IXMLValidator).\nWorks on linux-x64, osx-arm64 and win-x64.",
  "id": "AltovaGen",
